# Lead Cat core

- Single-purpose **Google Meet meetings-management Telegram Mini App**. Employees schedule, edit, and cancel meetings inside Telegram; the system creates Google Calendar events and sends notifications via a Telegram bot.
- One Postgres workspace + one Google service-account organizer (no multi-tenancy).
- Deploy: Dokploy — see `deploy/README.md`.
- Auth: TMA JWT primary — see `lead-cat-auth.mdc`.
- UI: cat design mandatory — see `cat-design.mdc`.
- KISS / DRY / SOLID; Clean Architecture in Go (`apps/backend/`) — see `AGENTS.md`; lite FSD in frontends — see `frontend-fsd.mdc`.
- Update `AGENTS.md`, `deploy/README.md`, or `deploy/.env.example` when changing API, env, auth, or deploy.
